# Testing And Evidence

## Evidence Required For Checkpoint Work

Write evidence under `develop/artifacts/**` with:

- input;
- scope and anti-scope;
- files changed;
- commands/checks run;
- results;
- known gaps;
- next step.

## Verification

- Run repo-native tests, lint, build or smoke commands when available.
- If checks cannot run, record the blocker.
- Do not claim broad correctness from narrow proof.
- For UI work, include browser or visual evidence when relevant.
